module jev_calibration_decision_route_outcome_metric_lsp

input decision_route_outcome_metric

status BOUND when route and outcome evidence are aligned
status DEFERRED when the producer is deferred
status UNKNOWN when metric evidence is invalid or incomplete

field metric_signal
field metric_digest
field observation_digest
field evidence_digest

constraint observation_only
constraint read_only
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
